      "id": "6aae756b0000000000365538",
      "text": "jedit",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789818220,
      "updated": 1789818258
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae75d10000000000365545",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789818442,
      "updated": 1789818442
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae75d10000000000365546",
      "text": "[テキストエディタ]の名前",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789818321,
      "updated": 1789818452
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae75380000000000365536",
      "text": "[bg.icon][**** [jEdit]]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789818169,
      "updated": 1789818327
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae75a8000000000036553e",
      "text": "https://www.jedit.org/",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789818280,
      "updated": 1789818284
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae75bf0000000000365544",
      "text": "> jEdit is a mature programmer's text editor with hundreds (counting the time developing [plugin]s) of person-years of development behind it.",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789818304,
      "updated": 1789818388
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae77040000000000365555",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789818628,
      "updated": 1789818628
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae766f0000000000365549",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789818480,
      "updated": 1789818480
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae76bc0000000000365554",
      "text": "命名の由来は明言されていないが、おそらくJavaで動くからjEditなのだろうと[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789818556,
      "updated": 1789818677
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae7672000000000036554a",
      "text": " > Some of jEdit's features include:",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789818483,
      "updated": 1789818486
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae7675000000000036554b",
      "text": " >  Written in [Java], so it runs on Mac OS X, [OS/2], Unix, [VMS] and Windows.",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789818486,
      "updated": 1789818546
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae7675000000000036554c",
      "text": " >  Built-in [macro] language; extensible plugin architecture. Hundreds of macros and plugins available.",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789818486,
      "updated": 1789818691
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae7675000000000036554d",
      "text": " >  Plugins can be downloaded and installed from within jEdit using the \"[plugin manager]\" feature.",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789818486,
      "updated": 1789818705
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae756e000000000036553c",
      "text": "[bg.icon][**** [Jedit]]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789818223,
      "updated": 1789818337
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae74fe0000000000365530",
      "text": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jedit",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789818111,
      "updated": 1789818116
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae74fe0000000000365531",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789818111,
      "updated": 1789818111
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae748c000000000036552c",
      "text": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jedit_X",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789817996,
      "updated": 1789817998
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae7481000000000036552a",
      "text": "> [Jedit X] is a commercial text editor made in Japan by [Artman21].",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789817985,
      "updated": 1789818392
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae74c6000000000036552e",
      "text": "  > It is a complete re-write of Jedit 4.0 in the [Cocoa API].",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789818055,
      "updated": 1789818063
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae74b5000000000036552d",
      "text": " > Jedit has been around since [1995] and is a general purpose text editor, with extra features related to supporting the Japanese language. It is available in both English and Japanese localizations.",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789818037,
      "updated": 1789818096
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae7481000000000036552b",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789817986,
      "updated": 1789817986
    }
  ]
}